Package: FoodDeliveryTools
Type: Package
Title: Estimation and Counterfactual Tools for "Fee Optimality in a Two-Sided Market"
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Michael R. Sullivan
Maintainer: Michael R. Sullivan <michael.rlld.sullivan@gmail.com>
Description: Helper functions for the structural estimation and
    counterfactual analysis in Sullivan (Journal of Political Economy),
    "Fee Optimality in a Two-Sided Market". The package gathers the
    data-preparation, demand-side, restaurant-side, and equilibrium
    routines used by the analysis scripts elsewhere in this replication
    archive.
